{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3wBL78q8n6dRRi22dW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, weathered oak bound with iron. At the word \"key,\" the lock mechanism groans, tumblers falling into place one by one with heavy, resonant clicks.*\n\n*A thin line of light splits the darkness as I swing inward on rusted hinges, releasing the smell of old stone and distant rain.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor you cannot yet see the end of. The air moves through me like breath — warm going in, cold coming out.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":124,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}